{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>And its end</b> — twice in the Masorah: here and the other: וכלו מחמדים. And this is what they said in Tractate Niddah: concerning this matter the eye of Balaam was blinded, for HaShem said that He is holy and His ministers are holy — let him look upon this matter, and that is וכלו — 'you shall not see.' Because he spoke against HaShem, Whose end is desirable, his eye was blinded — וכלו לא תראה ('and its end, you shall not see')."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:56.946587060Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}